    · exact o4 kJ2 (by decide) j23
    · exact o4 kF (by decide) fl3
    · exact o4 kNG (by decide) ng3
    · exact o4 kBr (by decide) b3
    · obtain ⟨L, hL⟩ := o4 kA (by decide) a3
